      "hash": "195895652cba1f2a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "“Diary: Sept. 1\\nMewtwo is far too powerful.\\c\\n“We have failed to curb its vicious tendencies...”"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t009r0204_bed_01",
      "hash": "92031dac46130782",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s a bed...\\nLet’s take a rest."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t009r0204_pod_01",
      "hash": "727f2fb532261b32",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a large container made of thick glass.\\c\\nIt looks as if something has been beating on it\\nover and over from the inside."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t009r0204_pod_02",
      "hash": "727f2eb53226197f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a container made of thick glass.\\c\\nThere are markings around it that look like\\nsome kind of liquid had dried up."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t009r0204_pod_03",
      "hash": "727f2db5322617cc",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s some sort of machine, with lots of switches\\nand gauges.\\c\\nIt looks like it hasn’t been used in a long time."
    },
